<item><title>Benin seeks CFA181,9 billion for farm investment and higher output</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-seeks-cfa181-9-billion-for-farm-investment-and-higher-f3db36/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-seeks-cfa181-9-billion-for-farm-investment-and-higher-f3db36/</guid><category>Benin</category><description>The proposed 2027 budget targets 724 281 tonnes of cotton, alongside higher cereal and soybean harvests.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 06:56:52 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bj.jpg" length="29969" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bj.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Benin&apos;s social security fund moves employer filings and payments online</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-s-social-security-fund-moves-employer-filings-and-c61816/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-s-social-security-fund-moves-employer-filings-and-c61816/</guid><category>Benin</category><description>From 1 December, employers must use the national public-services portal for registration certificates and social-contribution payments.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:42:49 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-s-social-security-fund-moves-employer-filings-and-c61816/share.jpg" length="44917" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-s-social-security-fund-moves-employer-filings-and-c61816/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>EU allocates 350 000 euros for displaced people in northern Benin</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/eu-allocates-350-000-euros-for-displaced-people-in-northern-99c270/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/eu-allocates-350-000-euros-for-displaced-people-in-northern-99c270/</guid><category>Benin</category><description>The extra funding targets people uprooted by violence and hunger, with the money earmarked for disaster preparation, protection, health and nutrition services.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:32:03 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bj.jpg" length="29969" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bj.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
